    "summary": "Formerly known as SOSO Clothing, and before that, simply a hunger\nto expertly express and represent men's fashion, delivering style\nand comfort.",
    "body": "OUR STORY\n\n## The Legacy of SOSO.\n\nSOSO Africa is a story of vision and evolution.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\nTHE JOURNEY\n\n01\n\nTHE BEGINNING\n\n## From a backyard to a vision.\n\nFormerly known as SOSO Clothing, and before that, simply a hunger\nto expertly express and represent men's fashion, delivering style\nand comfort.\n\nIt began as a modest tailoring operation in the backyard of our\nfounder's home in the University of Lagos, Nigeria.\n\n02\n\nCRAFT & COMMUNITY\n\n## Where creativity found its route.\n\nOur creativity first found its route in creating pieces for\nuniversity and departmental engagements, clothing our community\nwith expert craft, intention, dedication, and precision.\n\nLeaving its indelible footprint in the fashion space, it evolved\ninto SOSO Clothing, and today, SOSO Africa.\n\n03\n\nTHE FOUNDATION\n\n2018\n\nOur journey is rooted in encouragement, discipline, dedication,\nand service, with exceptional craftsmanship at our foundation.\n\nOfficially registered in August 2018, our experience and skills\ntrace back to a time years before that.\n\nIn every fabric and crafted piece lies a dedication to structural\nexcellence and the profound belief that a man's appearance is the\nfirst chapter of his story.\n\n04\n\nTHE EVOLUTION\n\n## From local passion to a Renaissance.\n\nToday, what began as a local passion has grown into SOSO Africa -\na brand that now stands for the modern Renaissance of African\nfashion.\n\nThroughout its journey, SOSO Africa has not only built a loyal\nclientele but also trained, mentored, and empowered dozens of\nstaff and external beneficiaries, many of whom have launched\ntheir own fashion brands.\n\nThe company's story reflects resilience, innovation, and a deep\ncommitment to community development through fashion.\n\n05\n\nBEYOND RETAIL\n\n## A fashion think tank.\n\nBeyond retail, SOSO Africa is a fashion think tank, a creative\nforge where concepts are transformed into unique designs.\n\nThese designs can also be sold independently as intellectual\nproperty to both B2B and B2C clients, making our creativity a\ntangible asset for the global market.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\n\n## What began as a local passion became a language for African fashion.",
