    "summary": "Our client is the Modern Man. He is sophisticated, ambitious,\nand unapologetically himself.",
    "body": "THE CLIENT\n\n## Dressing the Sophisticated Man.\n\nOur client is the Modern Man. He is sophisticated, ambitious,\nand unapologetically himself.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\nTHE MODERN MAN\n\n01\nTHE MODERN MAN\n\nWhether he is in a boardroom negotiating a deal or enjoying\na night out, he relies on SOSO Africa to elevate his presence.\n\nWe design for the man who understands that clothing is more than\nwhat you wear. It is how you enter a room, how you carry yourself,\nand how you choose to be remembered.\n\nTHE FULL SPECTRUM\n\nOF STYLE\n\nB2B / B2C\n\n02\n\nB2B\n\n## Business to Business.\n\nClothing that makes your organisation\nlook the part.\n\nWe provide corporate uniforms and bulk apparel that ensure your\nworkforce represents your brand with dignity and style.\n\nFrom churches, schools, companies, and event organizers in need\nof uniforms, branded garments, or embroidery services, to NGOs\nand empowerment agencies seeking to partner on youth training\ninitiatives.\n\nCorporate Uniforms\nBulk Apparel\nBranded Garments\nEmbroidery\nYouth Training\n\n03\n\nB2C\n\n## Business to Client.\n\nYour wardrobe, architected\naround you.\n\nDirect retail for the individual who demands the best.\n\nFrom bespoke tailoring to ready-to-wear collections,\nwe are your personal style architects.\n\nBespoke Tailoring\nReady-to-Wear\nPersonal Styling\n\nSOSO AFRICA\n\n## Dress with intention. Move with presence.",
