    "body": "OUR CRAFTSMANSHIP\n\n## Where Art Meets Precision.\n\nIf we are architects, then fabric is our cornerstone.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\nCRAFT / PRECISION / DETAIL\n\n01\nMATERIALS\n\n## The fabric is our cornerstone.\n\nWe source only the best materials, selecting fabrics that breathe,\ndrape and endure, from the finest mills across the globe.\n\nWe leave no stone unturned in sourcing materials — high-quality\nfabrics, zippers, lining, threads, sewing tools, and other\nproduction essentials serving designers, tailors, and fashion\nstartups — that deliver comfort, style, uniqueness and above all,\npreserve the distinct identity of SOSO Africa.\n\nWe constantly have our ears glued to the ground and our eyesight\nsharpened on the hunt for textiles that tell the story of SOSO and\nuphold our mission of comfort, durability and timeless style.\n\nTHE SOSO APPROACH\n\nWe treat every garment like a\nstructural blueprint.\n\n01\n\nPRECISION CUTTING\n\n## Every cut is deliberate.\n\nEvery cut is deliberate, designed to enhance the male silhouette.\n\n02\n\nSTRUCTURAL STITCHING\n\n## Engineered for movement.\n\nEvery seam is engineered for movement and longevity while carrying\nstyle through every color and contour.\n\n03\n\nUNCOMPROMISING FINISH\n\n## The inside must match the outside.\n\nWe believe the inside of a jacket should look as immaculate as the\noutside.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\n\n## We do not follow trends. We construct timeless pieces.",
