    "summary": "Our mission is as ambitious as our clients: to have a\nSOSO outfit in every wardrobe, cutting across every\ncontinent of the world.",
    "body": "LEGACY & VISION\n\n## A Wardrobe without Borders.\n\n01\n\nOur mission is as ambitious as our clients: to have a\nSOSO outfit in every wardrobe, cutting across every\ncontinent of the world.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\nAFRICAN FASHION / GLOBAL VISION\n\n02\nTHE MISSION\n\n## From Africa to the world.\n\nOur mission is not only to dress the modern African man,\nbut to build a continental brand that empowers the next\ngeneration of designers, tailors, and creative thinkers.\n\nAcross Nigeria, Ghana, Rwanda, Kenya, and beyond, we are\ncommitted to putting African fashion on the global map.\n\nA CONTINENTAL\n\nAMBITION\n\nOne vision. Many creative voices.\n\nNIGERIA\nGHANA\nRWANDA\nKENYA\nBEYOND\n\n03 — THE EVOLUTION\n\n## Staying dynamic.\n\nTo bring this vision to life, we stay dynamic and relevant.\nWe create in rhythm with the world while remaining rooted\nin the culture and craftsmanship that define SOSO Africa.\n\n04\n\nSEASONAL RELEASES\n\n## Four seasons. Endless expression.\n\n01 — SPRING\n02 — SUMMER\n03 — AUTUMN\n04 — WINTER\n\nWe release new collections in rhythm with the four seasons\nof the year, ensuring our clients are always at the forefront\nof global trends.\n\n05 — THE ANNUAL SHOWCASE\n\n## More than a runway.\n\nOur annual fashion show is not just a runway event;\nit is a cultural moment.\n\nIt is where we unveil our boldest visions and celebrate\nthe artistry of African menswear and culture.\n\nSOSO AFRICA\n\n## One wardrobe. Every continent.\n\nAfrican fashion, without borders.",
